stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Ignore: first packet of a rolling ID
  Ignore --> Aware: moving and dist <= 35 m
  Aware --> Warn: ttr <= 6 s
  Warn --> Urgent: ttr <= 3 s, or approaching and dist <= 6 m
  Urgent --> Warn: ttr > 4 s and not (approaching within 7 m), held 1.5 s
  Warn --> Aware: ttr > 7 s or no conflict, held 1.5 s
  Aware --> Ignore: dist > 40 m or parked (< 0.5 m/s), held 1.5 s
  Active --> Ignore: no packet for 2.5 s (stale)
  state Active {
    direction LR
    [*] --> any_level
    any_level: Aware, Warn or Urgent
  }
  note left of Ignore
    Upgrades may skip levels (e.g. Ignore to Urgent)
    and fire at once with an event: vibration + speech,
    at most once per level per track every 4 s.
  end note
  note right of Urgent
    Downgrades use looser exit thresholds
    (ttr +1 s, urgent dist +1 m, aware dist +5 m),
    must persist 1.5 s (hold), and are silent.
    Track forgotten after 30 s without packets.
  end note
